  description: "Emberwolf originated from a genetically enhanced security organism
    designed for high-temperature environments. When the containment fields failed,
    its metabolism fused with volatile energy residue from the reactors. The creature\u2019s
    internal heat never dissipates, forcing it into a constant state of aggression.
    What remains resembles neither animal nor machine, but a living furnace driven
    by instinct."
